@startuml IGshorts_Audience_Groups
title IGshorts — Where a local creator stands

skinparam backgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #1F2937
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam packageFontColor #0F172A
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam rectangleFontSize 13
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
skinparam noteBorderColor #10B981
skinparam noteFontColor #065F46

caption Followers only. No engagement rate. No worldwide rank. No live follower total.

package "What the page shows" {
  rectangle "**Major**\n10 million and above" as Major #1E3A8A;line:white
  rectangle "**Public**\n1 million to under 10 million" as Public #1D4ED8
  rectangle "**Established**\n100 thousand to under 1 million" as Established #3B82F6
  rectangle "**Community**\n10 thousand to under 100 thousand" as Community #93C5FD
  rectangle "**Not grouped yet**\nunder 10 thousand, or no reliable count" as None #E2E8F0
}

Major -[hidden]down- Public
Public -[hidden]down- Established
Established -[hidden]down- Community
Community -[hidden]down- None

note right of Established
  First reading uses the group
  that contains the count.
  105 thousand = Established.
  100 thousand and 101 thousand
  are the same group.
end note

package "How a search works" {
  rectangle "Visitor enters an exact handle" as Search
  rectangle "Already saved?" as Saved
  rectangle "Show the group and a state\nRecently checked\nUpdate overdue\nNot measured yet\nCould not verify" as Show
  rectangle "Approved source can read it?" as Source
  rectangle "Clear message\nNo guess. No zero." as Miss
  rectangle "Track this creator\nonly after a real count,\nor if they ask" as Track
  rectangle "Weekly refresh of tracked accounts\nLabel moves only after a clear step\ninto the next group" as Week
}

Search -down-> Saved
Saved -down-> Show : yes
Saved -down-> Source : no
Source -down-> Show : yes, keep the count private
Source -down-> Miss : no
Show -down-> Track
Track -down-> Week

note bottom of Week
  India and Global charts stay as they are.
  This lookup sits beside them.
  A failed check keeps the last good count.
end note

@enduml
